sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Program
    participant Controller as SceneController
    participant Scene
    participant Name as NameEntity
    participant Glyph as LineEntity
    participant Renderer as SplashKitDrawContext

    Note over User,Name: The first name has already been added by pressing N.
    User->>App: Right-click a name stroke at position
    App->>Scene: FindTopmostAt(position)
    Scene-->>App: Topmost drawable or none
    App->>Controller: SelectNameAt(position)
    Controller->>Scene: FindTopmostNameAt(position)
    Scene->>Name: Contains(position)
    Name->>Glyph: Contains(position), for each stroke
    Glyph-->>Name: Hit result
    Name-->>Scene: hit result
    Scene-->>Controller: NameEntity or none
    Controller-->>App: selection result
    App-->>User: Show selection highlight

    User->>App: Press left arrow
    App->>Controller: MoveSelected((-10, 0))
    Controller->>Name: MoveBy(offset)
    Name->>Glyph: MoveBy(offset), for each child
    Glyph-->>Name: Updated position
    App->>Scene: Draw(context)
    Scene->>Name: Draw(IDrawContext)
    Name->>Glyph: Draw(context), for each child
    Glyph->>Renderer: DrawLine(start, end, color, thickness)
    Renderer-->>Glyph: Draw complete
    App->>Renderer: DrawLine(..., gold selection highlight)
